### Register a user
POST {{api_host}}/auth/register
X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
#Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "username": "testtest",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "Testtest1!"
}

### Login user
POST {{api_host}}/auth/login
X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: some

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "Testtest1!"
}

### Request password reset email (always 202), check Mailpit UI at http://localhost:8025
POST {{api_host}}/auth/password/forgot
X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "email": "test@test.com"
}

### Reset password with the token from the email link
POST {{api_host}}/auth/password/reset
X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:3000

{
  "token": "<token from email>",
  "password": "Newpassword2@"
}
